ion for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{6}":[53,53],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{7}":[54,55],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{8}":[56,58],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{9}":[59,60],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{10}":[61,64],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{11}":[65,65],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{12}":[66,67],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{13}":[68,77],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{14}":[78,78],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{15}":[79,79],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{16}":[80,80],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{17}":[81,82],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{18}":[83,84],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{19}":[85,86],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{20}":[87,88],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{21}":[89,90],"##Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer#Instructions#{22}":[91,92]},"outlinks":[{"title":"How to set up Jira Spoke 2.5.1","target":"https://hi.service-now.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0792632","line":29},{"title":"Select a trigger for the flow","target":"/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=a27a7579472abe1077748d01426d43b0","line":39,"embedded":true},{"title":"Select the Action tab. In the left column, select Jira. From the menu that displays, select Create Issue","target":"/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=2e7a7579472abe1077748d01426d43b8","line":49,"embedded":true},{"title":"Select the Project Key. This defines in which Jira project the issue is created","target":"/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=a67a7579472abe1077748d01426d43c1","line":56,"embedded":true},{"title":"This flow now creates an issue in Jira whenever a new incident is created.","target":"/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=627a7579472abe1077748d01426d43bd","line":72,"embedded":true},{"title":"Go to the flow you just created. Select Test. Select an incident record. Select Run Test.","target":"/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=ea7a7579472abe1077748d01426d4368","line":83,"embedded":true},{"title":"After the run is complete, under RUNTIME VALUE, verify that the correct test name is reflected and that the result shows Success","target":"/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=6e7a7579472abe1077748d01426d43ab","line":87,"embedded":true},{"title":"Go to your Atlassian Jira instance. The issue just created is listed under the Project name.","target":"/sys_attachment.do?sys_id=d67a3579472abe1077748d01426d43a8","line":91,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer","aliases":["KB0793102"],"tags":["#servicenow","#support-kb"],"source_url":"https://support.servicenow.com/kb?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0793102","kb_number":"KB0793102","last_modified":"2026-01-20"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/support-and-troubleshooting/integrations/KB0793102 - Configure the Create Issue action for Jira in Flow Designer.md"},
